<Barack_Obama> <media_common.quotation_subject.quotations_about_this_subject> "“You are neither Christ nor King nor Lincoln.  But what you are is willing, capable, and sincere, there upon a bough of hope and audacity  as branded by history as any have ever been.” --from poem There Upon a Bough of Hope & Audacity" .
